// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P269881019" "Dream Doctor's Personal Story"
// tDetailString :
"P2843972940" "Dream Doctor returned to the Midnighter Club to discuss the next action to take with Montague Castanella. Mender Silos interrupted the conversation, demanding to see Dream Doctor in Ouroboros.<br><br>Dream Doctor travelled to Ouroboros, where he informed Mender Silos that he was <i>not</i> the one behind the temporal disturbances. He also revealed that he knew Mender Silos went back in time and tampered with the Dagger of Jocas, shifting it so the weapon would not destroy Rularuu. Silos admitted to this, saying that Rularuu will be needed to destroy the Coming Storm. Dream Doctor walked off, saying that humanity could handle the Coming Storm, and Ouroboros would come crashing down once Battalion was handled."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Montague 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3612646931" "Dream Doctor, it's good to speak with you again. The situation in Dark Astoria has calmed, at least with Mot. I'm afraid that there is still chaos there from all of the groups we had gotten together.<br><br>I don't think we'll be able to pull a stunt like that again for quite a long time."
// Answer Text :
"P2689374801" "It was a risky move. We're lucky it paid off."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1173611218" "Indeed we are. Now about - <br><br><color orange>A loud, commanding voice suddenly fills the halls of the Midnighter Club.</color><br><br><color GoldenRod>Dream Doctor. This is Mender Silos. I know what you have been doing all of this time. I know that you are the letter writer, and that you have the ability to reach Ouroboros.<br><br>I demand an audience with you immedietely. I will come alone, I expect you to do the same!</color><br><br>... Dream Doctor? Are you going to go?"
// Answer Text :
"P1341679985" "I must, Montague. Take care of things while I am gone. (Warp to Ouroboros)"
// Page Done Text :
"P856364347" ""
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P55270709" "<color CornflowerBlue>Matters in Dark Astoria were settled. Dream Doctor was forced to reveal himself before the time was right. He could have used the ability to time travel through dreamspace, but he had grown to believe that time travel was too dangerous a tool to use; it was dangerous enough trying to use it with {HeroName} to go back to Cimerora. In fact, if time travel had not been utilized in the first place, the Cimerorans could have saved themselves!<br><br>It was time now to speak with Montague Castanella to figure out what their next move would be. The Coming Storm loomed over the world. The results found in the attack on Bloody Bay and Galaxy City all pointed to Battalion...</color><br><br><color orange>This is a non-combat, personal story mission. In this mission, you will assume the role of your contact. This is a solo mission.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P1098866240" "(Play Dream Doctor's Personal Story)"
// SendOffString :
"P3459566050" "<color CornflowerBlue>Dream Doctor would make his way to the Midnighter Club. Montague Castanella was a trusted ally, someone who revealed to him an immense secret regarding the Dagger of Jocas. It was, in fact, Montague Castanella who set Dream Doctor upon the path that he was currently on.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3742196653" "Dream Doctor's Personal Story (Solo Mission)"
// YoureStillBusyString :
