// 5 Actor2 :
"P226636673" "<t=5 d=5>Dream Doctor, the letter writer. Clever, using dreamspace to time travel."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P121078728" "<t=5 d=5>Where are your lackeys, Silos?"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P3460174722" "<em no t=5 d=5>They're away on business. This is between you and I."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P4247241499" "<em thanks t=5 d=5>Why, Dream Doctor? Why have you been tampering with the fabric of time?"
// 5 Actor1 :
"P3901352472" "<em point t=5 d=5>How DARE you accuse me of such things. I KNOW what you've done, Silos!"
// 0 Actor2 :
"P1782313706" "<em stancevillain2>"
// 5 Actor1 :
"P2954533491" "<t=5 d=5>I stabbed Rularuu with the dagger of Jocas, and sealed the creature in the Shadow Shard."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P3196061227" "<em disagree t=5 d=5>But the dagger was supposed to DESTROY Rularuu. Montague Castanella told me the dagger had been altered by time travel..."
// 0 Actor1 :
"P4017280341" "<em StanceHero2>"
// 6 Caption :
"P2363225642" "<em x=0.5 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>YOU were the one who went back in time and stopped me from destroying Rularuu! WHY!"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P87275548" "<t=5 d=5>I've done the calculations. The only way for humanity to survive the Coming Storm is to use Rularuu."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P4046841446" "<em t=5 d=5>You're wrong, Silos. I have faith in humanity, that we CAN defeat the Coming Storm, Rularuu..."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P139092916" "<t=5 d=5>... And Ouroboros. The next time I am here, Silos, it will be to crash this abomination into the sea!"
// 5 Caption :
"P3458254260" "<x=0.5 y=0.5 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor GoldenRod>Dream Doctor... you were never my enemy, it seems. I truly hope the fates I have seen for you can be avoided..."
